                <note rend="inline" type="source">493.11/897: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Schurman</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-02-26T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 26,
                                1923—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>39. Your 65, February 23, noon.</p>
                <p>You are authorized to join your colleagues in signing note.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
